; atleast_k_above_n: ATLEAST with k greater than the number of indices
; raises IndexOutOfBounds.
;
; spec/xqvm/ISA.md's ATLEAST row: IndexOutOfBounds if k <= 0 or
; k > len(indices). atleast_k_range_before_model_type pins the k <= 0 half.

PUSH 4
BQMX r0
VECI r1
PUSH 0
VECPUSH r1
PUSH 1
VECPUSH r1       ; indices = [0, 1]
PUSH 3           ; k = 3 > 2
PUSH 1           ; penalty
ATLEAST r0 r1
HALT
